@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Sign in as the demo buyer (copy "token" into @buyerToken)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "marcus@soundwave.io" }

###
@buyerToken = paste-token-here

### 2. Reserve Vocal Booth B for one hour (copy "id" into @bookingId)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": "77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777777",
  "startTime": "2027-01-15T10:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2027-01-15T11:00:00Z"
}

###
@bookingId = paste-booking-id-here

### 3. Pay into escrow
POST {{host}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### 4. See the escrow saga's state and next deadline
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/workflow
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### 5. Escrow account and ledger
GET {{host}}/api/escrows/booking/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
